#: ../../source/docs/common-electro-permanent-magnet-V3.rst:13
#: 0ceb32783280410abdbb987f95fd6c77
msgid "Overview"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-electro-permanent-magnet-V3.rst:15
#: e44575f33959487d98c043c7753d1214
msgid "The *OpenGrab EPM v3* (from NicaDrone.com) is a small (less than 4cm x 4cm x 2cm) Electro Permanent Magnet gripper capable of 200N of force meaning it can hold about 15kg of cargo securely. The gripping and releasing of the cargo is accomplished by delivering a short pulse to an electromagnet which reverses it's field. Objects that it grips onto should be metal or have the included `thin steel target square <http://nicadrone.com/index.php?id_product=15&controller=product>`__ attached to them."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-electro-permanent-magnet-V3.rst:19
#: 64b63806f22a4080b80ea878e1325aa2
msgid "The device accepts a standard PWM servo input or DroneCAN and uses a 5V power supply. A significant amount of power is only required for about 1 second when it first grips or releases the cargo."
msgstr ""

